{
  "id": "invitation",
  "order": 7,
  "status": "published",
  "reviewed": false,
  "art": "invitation",
  "title": {
    "ar": "حين تُدعى إلى طعام",
    "en": "When you are invited to a meal"
  },
  "scene": {
    "ar": "يدعوك جارك المسلم إلى وليمة عرس أخيه نهاية الأسبوع. تتردد قليلًا لأنك لا تعرف أحدًا هناك.",
    "en": "Your Muslim neighbour invites you to his brother's wedding meal at the weekend. You hesitate a little, because you will not know anyone there."
  },
  "character": {
    "ar": "حسن، جارك",
    "en": "Hassan, your neighbour"
  },
  "learn": {
    "say": [
      {
        "ref": "h58120",
        "ar": "سَمِّ اللهَ، وَكُلْ بِيَمِينِكَ، وَكُلْ مِمَّا يَلِيكَ",
        "en": "mention Allah's name, eat with your right hand, and eat from what is nearer to you"
      }
    ],
    "why": [],
    "when": [
      {
        "ref": "h58112",
        "ar": "إذا دُعِيَ أحدكم إلى الوَلِيمَة فَلْيَأْتِهَا",
        "en": "If one of you is invited to a wedding banquet, he should attend"
      }
    ]
  },
  "exchanges": [
    {
      "id": "t1",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": {
            "ar": "أخي يتزوج يوم الجمعة، ويسرّنا أن تحضر الوليمة.",
            "en": "My brother is getting married on Friday, and we would love you to come to the wedding meal."
          }
        }
      ],
      "keyPoints": [
        {
          "id": "k1",
          "quote": {
            "ref": "h58112",
            "ar": "فَلْيَأْتِهَا",
            "en": "he should attend"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "k2",
          "quote": {
            "ref": "h3706",
            "ar": "وَإِجَابَةُ الدَّعْوَةِ",
            "en": "accepting invitations"
          }
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "quality": "best",
          "reply": [
            {
              "text": {
                "ar": "شكرًا لدعوتك، سأحضر بكل سرور.",
                "en": "Thank you for inviting me; I will gladly come."
              }
            }
          ],
          "meets": [
            "k1",
            "k2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "quality": "acceptable",
          "reply": [
            {
              "text": {
                "ar": "شكرًا لك، سأحاول أن أحضر.",
                "en": "Thank you, I'll try to come."
              }
            }
          ],
          "meets": [
            "k2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "quality": "avoid",
          "reply": [
            {
              "text": {
                "ar": "لا أظن، لا أعرف أحدًا هناك.",
                "en": "I don't think so; I won't know anyone."
              }
            }
          ],
          "meets": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "t2",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": {
            "ar": "(في الوليمة) تفضّل، هذا طبقك.",
            "en": "(At the meal) Here, this plate is for you."
          }
        }
      ],
      "keyPoints": [
        {
          "id": "k1",
          "quote": {
            "ref": "h58120",
            "ar": "سَمِّ اللهَ",
            "en": "mention Allah's name"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "k2",
          "quote": {
            "ref": "h58120",
            "ar": "وَكُلْ مِمَّا يَلِيكَ",
            "en": "and eat from what is nearer to you"
          }
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "quality": "best",
          "reply": [
            {
              "text": {
                "ar": "شكرًا لك. (تسمّي الله وتأكل مما يليك.)",
                "en": "Thank you. (You say Bismillah, then start from the side of the dish in front of you.)"
              }
            }
          ],
          "meets": [
            "k1",
            "k2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "quality": "acceptable",
          "reply": [
            {
              "text": {
                "ar": "شكرًا لك. (تسمّي الله وتبدأ.)",
                "en": "Thank you. (You say Bismillah and start.)"
              }
            }
          ],
          "meets": [
            "k1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "quality": "avoid",
          "reply": [
            {
              "text": {
                "ar": "(تمدّ يدك إلى أطباق الآخرين قبل أن تسمّي.)",
                "en": "(You reach across to other people's dishes before saying anything.)"
              }
            }
          ],
          "meets": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
